      ],
      "source": "https://grandjunction.com/history/exploring-the-rich-history-of-grand-junction-key-moments-and-landmarks"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The arrival of the Denver and Rio Grande Western Railroad in the late 19th century turned Grand Junction into a regional trade hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
